              <span class="tag is-light is-size-7"><a class="" href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-032-05114-1_27">10.1007/978-3-032-05114-1_27 <i class="fa fa-external-link" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span>
            </div>
