        DAWM: Diffusion Action <span class="search-hit mathjax">World</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> for Offline Reinforcement Learning via Action-Inferred Transitions
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+Z">Zongyue Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Han%2C+X">Xiao Han</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+Y">Yusong Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Strauss%2C+N">Niklas Strauss</a>, 
      
