    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        The Platonic Universe: Do <span class="search-hit mathjax">Foundation</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> See the Same Sky?
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=UniverseTBD"> UniverseTBD</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=%3A"> :</a>, 
      
